1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,692
Fill in the square.

2
00:00:01,692 --> 00:00:06,497
A normal girl, a normal boy, a carrier girl, and a colour blind boy.

3
00:00:06,497 --> 00:00:09,244
So one child in four is colour blind.

4
00:00:09,244 --> 00:00:12,278
But among sons only, it is one in two.

5
00:00:12,278 --> 00:00:16,822
Every daughter sees normally, though half are carriers.

